  "notes": "Usually used with ⟦の→の：09472_no⟧ before a noun: {手描|てが}き⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{看板|かんばん}→看板：00166_kanban⟧ (a hand-painted sign).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{手書|てが}き→手書き：08301_tegaki⟧: same reading, but means handwriting, writing words by hand. {手描|てが}き is for pictures and patterns; ⟦{手書|てが}き→手書き：08301_tegaki⟧ is for letters and text.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {手描|てが}き⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦イラスト→イラスト：10717_irasuto⟧: a hand-drawn illustration\n- {手描|てが}き⟦アニメ→アニメ：01527_anime⟧: hand-drawn animation\n- {手描|てが}き⟦{友禅|ゆうぜん}→友禅：33290_yuuzen⟧: hand-painted yūzen dyeing",
